---
title: "take (Sui Framework: kiosk)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_access: assert self.has_access(cap)
    q_check_access --> q_abort_owner: no access
    q_abort_owner --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_access --> q_check_locked: has access
    q_check_locked --> q_abort_locked: is_locked(id)
    q_abort_locked --> [*]: abort EItemLocked
    q_check_locked --> q_check_exclusive: not locked
    q_check_exclusive --> q_abort_exclusive: is_listed_exclusively(id)
    q_abort_exclusive --> [*]: abort EListedExclusively
    q_check_exclusive --> q_check_exists: not exclusive
    q_check_exists --> q_abort_exists: !has_item(id)
    q_abort_exists --> [*]: abort EItemNotFound
    q_check_exists --> q_cleanup: item exists
    q_cleanup --> q_dec_count: self.item_count - 1
    q_dec_count --> q_remove_listing: df::remove_if_exists(Listing, non-exclusive)
    q_remove_listing --> q_remove_item: dof::remove(Item(id))
    q_remove_item --> [*]: return item

    note right of q_check_access
        INV-001: only kiosk owner can take items
        INV-002: locked items cannot be taken (must be sold)
        INV-003: exclusively listed items cannot be taken
        INV-004: non-exclusive listings are cleaned up on take
    end note
